{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Be the Block</i></strong> is a puzzle game where your goal is to move every block on the board to its target. But instead of using a character to push the blocks around, you control the blocks directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of the game is its <strong>multi-agent movement</strong> mechanic. Each block can move only in its assigned directions, and when you press an arrow key, every block able to move that direction does so simultaneously. This creates a world of satisfyingly <strong>simple yet challenging</strong> block-manipulation puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.poster.avif?t=1759003567\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.webm?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.mp4?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design principle behind the puzzles is simplicity: it\u2019s immediately obvious what needs to be done, but the challenge is figuring out how. This also means the difficulty isn\u2019t increased by adding more and more blocks, but by cleverly manipulating the win conditions. As an example, compare the following GIF to the previous one and you may notice that it shows a level that is equally simple yet considerably more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/0c48c0ded63d253c6f09f7de3c98e5be.poster.avif?t=1759003567\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/0c48c0ded63d253c6f09f7de3c98e5be.webm?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/0c48c0ded63d253c6f09f7de3c98e5be.mp4?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handful of additional mechanics are introduced as you progress, but all of them complement the main mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Be the Block</i></strong> is all about puzzles. There\u2019s no story, no overworld, and no forced progression barriers. It\u2019s simply a collection of hand-crafted puzzles, all unlocked from the start. While you can tackle them in any order, you may find it easier to grasp the subtleties of each mechanic by playing them sequentially.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971050?t=1759003567","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971050?t=1759003567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/1409bd99276fb2a0bbae767a48a2ca5510c8ca87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759003567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/1409bd99276fb2a0bbae767a48a2ca5510c8ca87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759003567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Be the Block</i></strong> is a puzzle game where your goal is to move every block on the board to its target. But instead of using a character to push the blocks around, you control the blocks directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of the game is its <strong>multi-agent movement</strong> mechanic. Each block can move only in its assigned directions, and when you press an arrow key, every block able to move that direction does so simultaneously. This creates a world of satisfyingly <strong>simple yet challenging</strong> block-manipulation puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.poster.avif?t=1759003567\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.webm?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.mp4?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The design principle behind the puzzles is simplicity: it\u2019s immediately obvious what needs to be done, but the challenge is figuring out how. This also means the difficulty isn\u2019t increased by adding more and more blocks, but by cleverly manipulating the win conditions. As an example, compare the following GIF to the previous one and you may notice that it shows a level that is equally simple yet considerably more difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/0c48c0ded63d253c6f09f7de3c98e5be.poster.avif?t=1759003567\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/0c48c0ded63d253c6f09f7de3c98e5be.webm?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/0c48c0ded63d253c6f09f7de3c98e5be.mp4?t=1759003567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handful of additional mechanics are introduced as you progress, but all of them complement the main mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Be the Block</i></strong> is all about puzzles. There\u2019s no story, no overworld, and no forced progression barriers. It\u2019s simply a collection of hand-crafted puzzles, all unlocked from the start. While you can tackle them in any order, you may find it easier to grasp the subtleties of each mechanic by playing them sequentially.</p>","developers":["Rivernos Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/d7412c4569dab98f2006b36cc20956aaf83da162/header.jpg?t=1759003567","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  macOS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 or ARM CPU (Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3971050/62886885/aee55c298027c911e6d201adca5b10c8a7ebded4/1758397785/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758431751","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3971050/62886885/aee55c298027c911e6d201adca5b10c8a7ebded4/1758397785/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758431751","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3971050/62886885/aee55c298027c911e6d201adca5b10c8a7ebded4/1758397785/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758431751","id":257202966,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.s